# NAME: X-US-Loon
# REVIEWED: 2026-09-23
# FORMAT: Loon remote rule set; select the US-only policy in Loon.
# SCOPE: X/Twitter domains and network fallbacks; no zero-leak guarantee.
# Domain facts checked against blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script and v2fly/domain-list-community.
# IP/ASN data adapted from Loyalsoldier/geoip; CC BY-SA 4.0, supplied AS IS.
# https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/geoip/release/text/twitter.txt
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Loyalsoldier/geoip/master/config.json
# Changes: Loon syntax, grouped domains, IPv4/IPv6 snapshot, ASN fallback.
# No strategy names, FINAL, or General settings belong in this remote list.

# Core services, API, media, short links, live audio/video
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twitter.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,twimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pscp.tv
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,periscope.tv
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tweetdeck.com

# Supporting and legacy domains; grok.com retained for original-list compatibility
